FlowBit
=======

FlowBit is a downstream rebrand of:

  netsampler/goflow2 v2.2.4 (commit c538a96)
  https://github.com/netsampler/goflow2
  Copyright (c) 2021, NetSampler

All upstream code retains its original BSD 3-Clause License (see LICENSE).
The upstream "goflow2" trademark / project name is the property of the
upstream maintainers; this fork does NOT claim ownership of the upstream
name or any associated trademarks.

Changes in this fork (FlowBit):
  - Go module path rewritten to github.com/dkg-netinsight/flowbit/v2
  - cmd/goflow2/ renamed to cmd/flowbit/
  - Binary name "goflow2" renamed to "flowbit"
  - Version banner "GoFlow2" renamed to "FLOWBIT"
  - Prometheus metric namespace "goflow2_" renamed to "flowbit_"
  - Proto go_package options rewritten

No upstream logic, decoders, transports, formats, or wire protocols
were modified. This fork exists solely to bind the binary identity
to the NETINSIGHT ingestor packaging and to avoid metric/namespace
collisions when both projects are deployed side-by-side.

Maintainer: dkg-netinsight (see github.com/dkg-netinsight/flowbit)
Owner contact: dimple9292.dkg@gmail.com
